{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They are coming...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Tommy, a 9 year old boy who finds himself in a mysterious video game club from the 1990s. Your only goal is to enjoy the arcade machines and have fun But something strange is waiting for you here... Something far beyond what Tommy has ever experienced...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif01.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird noises echo around you, and to escape this nightmare, you must enter a strange video game. This game not only challenges you with 2D platforming obstacles but also forces you to solve complex puzzles and face the deepest fears within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif02.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With captivating 3D realistic graphics and a gripping storyline, <strong>THEM</strong> blends first-person Psychological Horror with retro 2D-Platformer gameplay, creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif03.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 First-person gameplay + 2D platforming elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A deep and captivating story with unexpected twists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Engaging and mysterious 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Find Hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Diverse Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple Endings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join <strong>THEM</strong> and see if you can escape this nightmare or will you become a part of them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553320?t=1745821186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553320?t=1745821186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/27f776a72bb50f882dd2db0a0f134b232c02d4fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745821186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/27f776a72bb50f882dd2db0a0f134b232c02d4fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745821186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST THEM!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most significant way to support development at this point is to wishlist &quot;<strong>THEM</strong>&quot;. Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/wishlist_follow.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>They are coming...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Tommy, a 9 year old boy who finds himself in a mysterious video game club from the 1990s. Your only goal is to enjoy the arcade machines and have fun But something strange is waiting for you here... Something far beyond what Tommy has ever experienced...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif01.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird noises echo around you, and to escape this nightmare, you must enter a strange video game. This game not only challenges you with 2D platforming obstacles but also forces you to solve complex puzzles and face the deepest fears within you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif02.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With captivating 3D realistic graphics and a gripping storyline, <strong>THEM</strong> blends first-person Psychological Horror with retro 2D-Platformer gameplay, creating a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/extras/Them_Gif03.gif?t=1745821186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 First-person gameplay + 2D platforming elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A deep and captivating story with unexpected twists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Engaging and mysterious 3D environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Find Hidden objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Diverse Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple Endings...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join <strong>THEM</strong> and see if you can escape this nightmare or will you become a part of them!</p>","developers":["Lexip Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553320/header.jpg?t=1745821186","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101400,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101400/movie480.mp4?t=1745679121","max":"h